        {
          "type": "faq",
          "layout": "accordion",
          "heading": "Good to know",
          "items": [
            {
              "question": "What should I include when I ask about a cake?",
              "answer": "Share the occasion, the date, roughly how many people it should serve, the flavours you like, any allergies, and a photo or colour idea for the decoration. The more detail you give, the easier it is to come back with the right options."
            },
            {
              "question": "Can I ask about small chops for an event?",
              "answer": "Yes. Send the date, the number of guests and the snacks you have in mind through the enquiry form, and ask about collection or delivery arrangements at the same time."
            },
            {
              "question": "How early should I enquire about a celebration?",
              "answer": "As early as you can. Dates fill up around weddings, holidays and the weekends, so an early message gives everyone room to plan."
            },
            {
              "question": "Where can I see examples of the work?",
              "answer": "The gallery shows illustrative baking and party-food photography to give you a feel for the style. Ask in your enquiry for examples that match your occasion."
            }
          ]
        },
